    "publication_date": "2020-01-26",
    "description": "<p>This dataset contains the raw measurement data and MATLAB scripts for the following publication: S. Joshi and J. Paik, &quot;Multi-DoF Force Characterization of Soft Actuators,&quot; in&nbsp;<em>IEEE Robotics and Automation Letters</em>, vol. 4, no. 4, pp. 3679-3686, Oct. 2019.&nbsp;doi: 10.1109/LRA.2019.2927936</p>\n\n<p><br>\nThe .csv files contain measured values of soft actuator pressure, displacement and force output. The MATLAB scripts help to extract and plot this raw data.</p>",
